<div class="wb-check-options wb-resistance-editor">
  <fieldset><legend>Resistant to</legend>
    <div class="wb-resistance-options">
    {{#each types}}
      <label class="wb-equipment-check"><input
        type="checkbox"
        name="{{field}}"
        {{#if selected}}checked{{/if}}
      > {{label}}</label>
    {{/each}}
    </div>
  </fieldset>
  <label>Custom resistances <small>One per line</small><textarea
    name="custom"
    rows="3"
    placeholder="Lightning&#10;Cold"
  >{{custom}}</textarea></label>
  <fieldset><legend>Immune to</legend>
    <div class="wb-resistance-options">
    {{#each immunity.types}}
      <label class="wb-equipment-check"><input
        type="checkbox"
        name="{{field}}"
        {{#if selected}}checked{{/if}}
      > {{label}}</label>
    {{/each}}
    </div>
  </fieldset>
  <label>Custom immunities <small>One per line</small><textarea
    name="customImmunity"
    rows="3"
    placeholder="Poison&#10;Necrotic"
  >{{immunity.custom}}</textarea></label>
  <details class="wb-disclosure wb-help"><summary>Resistance and immunity help</summary>
    <p>Resistance halves damage of that type, rounded down, before Armor Rating. Immunity stops it completely, Overwhelming Force included. A weapon with two damage types (Mace: Bludgeoning, Piercing) needs both resisted or both immune.</p>
    <p>Automatic attack resolution applies both. Presets cover types named in Game Systems; add any other types above. Clear all entries and checkboxes to remove them.</p>
  </details>
</div>
